 "exceptions": [
  {
   "explanation": "Not a recording made by scripts/oracle/record's protocol. On a fresh output base the oracle's `aquery deps(//src/workerd/server:workerd) --output=jsonproto` exits 8 (build interrupted) and leaves no usable output; label oracle-9.3.2-workerd holds that recording unchanged (aquery_actions FAILED, exit code 8). In this record the exit code of aquery_deps_jsonproto was changed by hand from 8 to 0 and raw/aquery_deps_jsonproto.stdout was replaced by the output of the same command run on ~/.cache/blaze/oracle-out/ur-workerd after a full oracle build (scripts/workerd/run oracle aquery ...; docs/workerd.md). Absolute paths in it name that output base and are not normalised. A candidate that exits 0 and prints these actions matches something the oracle does not do under the protocol, so the two surfaces are compared for information and never count as a pass.",
   "id": "workerd-aquery-spliced",
